{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Daffodil is found via ",["l","采集","foraging"]," in the ",["l","春季","Spring"],", or grown from ",["l","春季种子","Spring Seeds"],". Up to ten can also be purchased from ",["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"]," at the ",["l","花舞节","Flower Dance"]," for 50g each. Up to five may be purchased from ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],"'s ",["l","沙漠节","shop"]," at the ",["l","沙漠节","Desert Festival"]," for 15 Calico Eggs ",["l","卡利科三花蛋","Calico Egg"],"s each. It can randomly be found in ",["l","垃圾桶","Garbage Can"],"s during Spring. The ",["l","无尽财富之雕像","Statue Of Endless Fortune"]," produces one Daffodil per year on ",["l","桑迪","Sandy"],"'s birthday, ",["l","秋季","Fall 15"],". Although it is a flower in its description (and in real life), the game classifies it as \"Forage\" and not \"Flower.\""]]]],["Healing",2,[["p",["The Daffodil is edible, but does not increase ",["l","能量","Energy"]," or ",["l","生命值","Health"],"."]]]],["Gifting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Love"]},[["l","桑迪","Sandy"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Like"]},[["l","莱纳斯","Linus"],", ",["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"],", ",["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],", ",["l","乔治","George"],", ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", ",["l","潘姆","Pam"],", ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],", ",["l","海莉","Haley"],", ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","文森特","Vincent"],", ",["l","肯特","Kent"],", ",["l","莉亚","Leah"],", ",["l","格斯","Gus"],", ",["l","哈维","Harvey"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Neutral"]},[["l","罗宾","Robin"],", ",["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"],", ",["l","玛鲁","Maru"],", ",["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],", ",["l","亚历克斯","Alex"],", ",["l","刘易斯","Lewis"],", ",["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","潘妮","Penny"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Dislike"]},[["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"],", ",["l","山姆","Sam"],", ",["l","谢恩","Shane"],", ",["l","艾利欧特","Elliott"],", ",["l","矮人","Dwarf"],", ",["l","法师","Wizard"],", ",["l","威利","Willy"],", ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"],", ",["l","雷欧","Leo"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Hate"]},[["l","乔迪","Jodi"]]]]]]],["Bundles",2,[["p",["Daffodil is used in the Crafts Room."]]]],["Recipes",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Description"]},{"h":1,"v":["Ingredients"]},{"h":1,"v":["Recipe Source"]},{"h":1,"v":["Sell Price"]}],[[["l","打造","Wild Seeds (Sp)"]],["An assortment of wild spring seeds.\n(Produces 10 Spring Seeds per craft.)"],[["i","(O)16","Wild Horseradish ×1"],["i","(O)18","Daffodil ×1"],["i","(O)20","Leek ×1"],["i","(O)22","Dandelion ×1"]],[["l","采集","Foraging"]," Level 1"],["35g"]]]]]],["Tailoring",2,[["p",["Daffodil is used in the spool of the ",["l","柳巷2号","Sewing Machine"]," to create a ",["l","裁缝","Shirt"],". It can be used in ",["l","染色","dyeing"],", serving as a yellow dye at the dye pots, located in ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],"'s and ",["l","海莉","Haley"],"'s house, ",["l","柳巷2号","2 Willow Lane"],"."]]]],["Quests",2,[["p",["Daffodil may be randomly requested in ",["l","春季","Spring"]," at the ",["l","任务","\"Help Wanted\" board"]," outside ",["l","皮埃尔的杂货店","Pierre's General Store"]," for a reward of 90g and 150 ",["l","友谊","Friendship"]," points."]]]]],"f":[["Source",[["l","采集","Foraging"]," • ",["l","春季种子","Spring Seeds"]," • purchase at the ",["l","花舞节","Flower Dance"]]],["Season",["Spring"]],["Sell Price",["30g"]]]}